==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*5 [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Clyde Gory]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Clyde Gory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Inky Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**8 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

